"<div class=\"brand-bar\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"brand-logo\"><div class=\"brand-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div></div>\n<header class=\"lk-hd\"><div class=\"lk-topic\"><svg class=\"ic\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.5\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\"><path d=\"M4 20l1-4.2L16.2 4.6a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 2.3 0l.9.9a1.6 1.6 0 0 1 0 2.3L8.2 19z\"/><path d=\"M14.5 6.4l3.1 3.1\"/></svg></div><div class=\"lk-kicker\">Wiederholung</div><div class=\"lk-big\">R3</div><h1>통합 복습 3</h1><div class=\"lk-de\">Wiederholung 3 · Lektion 21–29</div><div class=\"lk-intro\">Lektion 21부터 29까지 배운 문법을 섞어서 풀어요.<br>여러 과의 문법이 한 문장에 함께 나와요. 기본 7 · 중간 5 · 도전 4 문제예요.<div class=\"x-goals\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">이 복습에서 확인할 것</div><div class=\"x-goal\">형용사 어미와 비교급을 문장 속에서 골라요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">시간 접속사와 zu 부정형으로 문장을 이어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">관계대명사를 역할과 성으로 정해요</div></div><div class=\"x-goals\" style=\"margin-top:14px\"><div class=\"x-goals-t\">풀이 방법</div><div class=\"x-goal\">보기를 고르거나, 빈칸에 쓰거나, 단어를 눌러 문장을 만들어요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">빈칸 옆 괄호와 한국어 뜻이 힌트예요. 대문자와 소문자는 구별하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">단어 배열에는 문장부호가 없어요. 문법에 맞는 어순이면 모두 정답이에요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">바꿔 쓰기는 문장 전체를 써요. 쉼표와 마침표는 채점하지 않아요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">틀린 곳 찾기는 문장에서 틀린 단어 하나를 눌러요</div><div class=\"x-goal\">푼 답은 이 기기에 저장돼요. 새로고침하거나 앱을 업데이트해도 남아 있어요</div></div></div></header>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge review-badge\">기본</span><span class=\"sub-title\">기본 문제 · 배운 내용을 그대로 확인해요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"fd8fcf9df4\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">1.</strong> Ich nehme <span class=\"qblank\"></span> Rucksack hier.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">a) diesem</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">b) dieses</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) dieser</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) diesen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">Rucksack은 남성 4격이에요 → diesen (22과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"2e8c431579\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;schwarzen&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">2.</strong> Er trägt heute einen <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:11ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(schwarz)</span> Mantel.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 오늘 검은 외투를 입었어요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Er trägt heute einen <b>schwarzen</b> Mantel.</div>einen 뒤 남성 4격은 -en이에요 (24과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"251899fd8b\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">3.</strong> Mein Bruder ist zwei Jahre <span class=\"qblank\"></span> als ich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) mehr alt</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) am ältesten</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) alter</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) älter</button></div><div class=\"qe\">alt의 비교급은 움라우트가 붙어 älter예요 (25과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b907f2d098\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;die&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">4.</strong> Das ist die Frau, <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:5ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"> ich gestern im Park gesehen habe.</div><div class=\"qko\">이분이 내가 어제 공원에서 본 여자예요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist die Frau, <b>die</b> ich gestern im Park gesehen habe.</div>관계문 속 4격 목적어, 여성 → die (29과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4bd0e21fa2\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"0\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">5.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">우리가 작년에 로마에 있었을 때 박물관을 많이 갔어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Wenn</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">letztes</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Jahr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">in</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">Rom</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">waren,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">haben</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">wir</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"9\">viele</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"10\">Museen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"11\">besucht.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Als wir letztes Jahr in Rom waren, haben wir viele Museen besucht.</b></div>과거에 한 번 있었던 때는 als예요 (27과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"141f8a4f68\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich lerne Deutsch, um in Wien zu studieren.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">6.</strong> um … zu로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich lerne Deutsch, damit ich in Wien studieren kann.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 6\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich lerne Deutsch, um in Wien zu studieren.</b></div>주어가 같으면 damit 대신 um … zu를 써요 (28과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"ba715cb4ae\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">7.</strong> Wir haben vor, morgen sehr früh <span class=\"qblank\"></span>.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">a) aufbrechen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) aufgebrochen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">c) zu aufbrechen</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) aufzubrechen</button></div><div class=\"qe\">분리동사는 접두어와 동사 사이에 zu가 들어가요 (28과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">중간</span><span class=\"sub-title\">중간 문제 · 조건이 한두 개 더 붙어요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"69016c2bf0\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;warmer&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">8.</strong> Ich trinke Tee mit <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:8ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(warm)</span> Milch.</div><div class=\"qko\">나는 따뜻한 우유를 넣은 차를 마셔요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Ich trinke Tee mit <b>warmer</b> Milch.</div>관사 없는 여성 3격은 강변화 -er이에요 (24과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"b7574fdee1\" class=\"qi qr\" data-t=\"order\" data-a=\"[&quot;Er verließ das Haus ohne sich zu verabschieden&quot;,&quot;Ohne sich zu verabschieden verließ er das Haus&quot;,&quot;Das Haus verließ er ohne sich zu verabschieden&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">9.</strong> 단어를 알맞은 순서로 놓으세요.</div><div class=\"qko\">그는 작별 인사도 하지 않고 집을 나갔어요.</div><div class=\"qbuild\" aria-live=\"polite\"></div><div class=\"qpool\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"0\">sich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"1\">zu</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"2\">ohne</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"3\">verabschieden</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"4\">Haus</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"5\">verließ</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"6\">das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qc\" data-i=\"7\">Er</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"clr\">지우기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Er verließ das Haus, ohne sich zu verabschieden.</b></div>ohne … zu 구문이에요. 재귀대명사 sich는 zu 앞에 와요 (17·28과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"cac581b194\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"5\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">10.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">이 사람이 내가 함께 일하는 동료예요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Das</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">ist</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">Kollege,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">mit</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">den</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">zusammenarbeite.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Das ist der Kollege, mit dem ich zusammenarbeite.</b></div>mit는 3격 지배예요. 남성 3격 관계대명사는 dem이에요 (29과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"4970ab2763\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Nachdem wir gegessen hatten, spülten wir ab.&quot;,&quot;Wir spülten ab, nachdem wir gegessen hatten.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">11.</strong> nachdem으로 한 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Wir hatten gegessen. Danach spülten wir ab.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 11\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Nachdem wir gegessen hatten, spülten wir ab.</b></div>먼저 끝난 일은 과거완료로 nachdem 문장에 넣어요 (26·27과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"8a98114313\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">12.</strong> Je länger ich warte, <span class=\"qblank\"></span> nervöser werde ich.</div><div class=\"qg\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">a) als</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">b) wie</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) so</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">d) desto</button></div><div class=\"qe\">je + 비교급, desto + 비교급이에요 (25과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"sub-head\"><span class=\"sub-badge\">도전</span><span class=\"sub-title\">도전 문제 · 함정과 예외까지 따져 봐요</span></div><div class=\"quiz-block\">\n<div data-id=\"272fc7a5cb\" class=\"qi qt\" data-t=\"tr\" data-a=\"[&quot;Ich habe einen Freund, dessen Vater Pilot ist.&quot;]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">13.</strong> 관계문으로 한 문장으로 바꿔 쓰세요.</div><div class=\"qsrc\" lang=\"de\">Ich habe einen Freund. Sein Vater ist Pilot.</div><textarea class=\"qtr\" rows=\"2\" lang=\"de\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" aria-label=\"바꿔 쓴 문장 13\"></textarea><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · <b>Ich habe einen Freund, dessen Vater Pilot ist.</b></div>소유는 dessen(남성·중성) · deren(여성·복수)이에요 (29과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"60b8b0e947\" class=\"qi qx\" data-t=\"err\" data-x=\"2\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">14.</strong> 틀린 단어를 하나 눌러요.</div><div class=\"qko\">내가 도와준 그 남자는 아주 고마워했어요.</div><div class=\"qtok\" lang=\"de\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"0\">Der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"1\">Mann,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"2\">der</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"3\">ich</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"4\">geholfen</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"5\">habe,</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"6\">war</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"7\">sehr</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qw\" data-w=\"8\">dankbar.</button></div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">고친 문장 · <b>Der Mann, dem ich geholfen habe, war sehr dankbar.</b></div>helfen은 3격 동사예요. 남성 3격 관계대명사는 dem이에요 (18·29과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"e99a39fb84\" class=\"qi qf\" data-t=\"fill\" data-a=\"[[&quot;spannendste&quot;]]\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">15.</strong> Das ist das <input class=\"qin\" type=\"text\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocapitalize=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" style=\"width:13ch\" aria-label=\"빈칸 1\"><span class=\"qh\">(spannend · 최상급)</span> Buch, das ich je gelesen habe.</div><div class=\"qko\">이건 내가 지금까지 읽은 책 중 가장 흥미진진한 책이에요.</div><div class=\"qa\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb\" data-q=\"chk\">확인</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"show\">정답 보기</button><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"redo\">다시 풀기</button></div><div class=\"qe\"><div class=\"qsol\">정답 · Das ist das <b>spannendste</b> Buch, das ich je gelesen habe.</div>최상급도 형용사 어미를 받아요. 정관사 뒤 중성 1격 → -e (23·25과).</div></div>\n<div data-id=\"d160e716ec\" class=\"qi\"><div class=\"qq\"><strong class=\"qn\">16.</strong> Welcher Satz ist richtig?</div><div class=\"qg qg1\"><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"1\" data-k=\"0\">a) Es ist wichtig, regelmäßig Sport zu treiben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"1\">b) Es ist wichtig, regelmäßig zu Sport treiben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"2\">c) Es ist wichtig, zu regelmäßig Sport treiben.</button><button class=\"qo\" data-c=\"0\" data-k=\"3\">d) Es ist wichtig, regelmäßig Sport treiben zu.</button></div><div class=\"qe\">zu는 원형 바로 앞에 붙고, zu 부정형은 끝에 와요 (28과).</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"qscore\" data-total=\"16\" data-no-print><div class=\"qscore-t\">맞힌 문제 <b class=\"qscore-n\">0</b> / 16</div><div class=\"qscore-bar\"><i></i></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"qb is-ghost\" data-q=\"all\">모두 다시 풀기</button></div>\n<div class=\"brand-foot\"><img src=\"%%A0%%\" alt=\"Sophia Deutsch Akademie\" class=\"foot-logo\"><div class=\"foot-name\">Sophia Deutsch Akademie</div><div class=\"foot-tag\">Innovative Learning Beyond the Traditional</div></div>"